    dreamy: ["It doesn't matter if it happened. It's true either way.", "In some world it happened. Maybe this one."],
    witty: ["Did it happen? It does now. You told it.", "About as true as my fishing stories. So, broadly."],
    proud: ["I should think so. You'd not lie to us.", "I believe it. A wizard's word is a wizard's word."],
