    eagles: ["An eagle. Swooping in. Saving the day. Not frightened of anything.", "The wizard up the tree, thinking up last words."],
    greenfields: ["Bullroarer. One swing. Then off for lunch.", "The rabbit, with a goblin's head arriving down the hole."],
    fellwinter: ["The one who blew the horn. Loudly.", "A baker with a pitchfork. Shoulder to shoulder."],
    oldtook: ["The Old Took! Dancing till dawn at a hundred and thirty!", "Whoever's haystack caught fire."],
    sea: ["The elf on the quay with the lantern. Looking West.", "A gull. Watching the ships go."],
